 and France's Salle Cortot. A prolific chamber musician\, he tours widely 
 as a member of Civitas Ensemble\, Duo Diorama (with violinist MingHuan Xu
 )\, and Trio Diorama (with Xu and cellist Nick Photinos)\, and recently p
 erformed with Matthias Goerne at the Ravinia Festival. A passionate advoc
 ate for new music\, Choi has premiered and commissioned over 100 works. H
 is recordings include Elliott Carter's complete piano music\, Jacques Len
 ot's works (winner of the Grand Prix du Disque)\, and music by Thomas Ad�
 �s. He appears on such labels as BIS\, Cedille\, and Naxos\, and is a cor
