 erforming alongside such artists as trombonists Joseph Alessi\, Brian Hec
 ht\, and Martin Schippers\; double bassist Artem Chirkov\; violinist Chin
 g-Yi Lin\; and violist Andrew Braddock\, among others. Additional perform
