 tring Academy of Wisconsin. Increasingly sought after as a teacher\, she 
 is a professor of violin at the Amsterdam Conservatory (young talent prog
 ram) and the ArtEZ Conservatory in Zwolle. She has given master classes i
 n the United States\, the Netherlands\, France\, Belgium\, Spain\, Italy\
 , Brazil\, Columbia and Hong Kong\, and is a faculty member of the Indian
 a University Summer String Academy. Born in Milwaukee\, Wisconsin\, Kapus
 tin currently resides in Zwolle\, the Netherlands\, with her husband\, vi
